      "instance_name": "girls_smiling_together",
      "label": "girls smiling together",
      "description": "A group of five young girls, likely from a non-Western cultural context, are positioned closely together and smiling or looking at the camera. They are wearing colorful headscarves and appear to be in a natural outdoor setting. The scene is framed to capture their expressions and camaraderie.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
