      "instance_name": "happiness",
      "label": "genuine happiness expressed through smiling",
      "description": "The girls in the image are displaying authentic expressions of joy, with wide smiles and bright eyes, suggesting genuine happiness rather than forced or performative emotion. Their body language and facial expressions convey warmth and positivity.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
