      "label": "Misogynous",
      "description": "The meme reduces the girls' identities to their facial expressions and enforces a specific emotional performance (smiling), reflecting the stereotype that women, especially women of color, are valued primarily for their appearance and emotional compliance.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
